# skhd config for Markdug
# Installed to ~/.skhdrc by install-trigger.sh
#
# Option+Space renders the .md file currently selected in Finder
# (and toggles the window closed if Markdug is already open).
# Reuses km-macro.sh unchanged — skhd just supplies the global hotkey.
#
# Assumes the repo is cloned to ~/Sites/Markdug. If you clone elsewhere,
# edit the path below (or re-run install-trigger.sh, which rewrites it).
alt - space : ~/Sites/Markdug/km-macro.sh
